import source_buffers.dl

to get [the UI source editor in] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    set editor to (tools's workspace as a pointer to UI source workspace)'s editors
    loop while editor != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source editor):
        if editor's node = tools's node:
            return editor
        set editor to editor's next
    require condition false reporting "The source tools have no registered editor"
    return editor

to get [focus UI source tools] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    set workspace to tools's workspace as a pointer to UI source workspace
    set view to tools's view
    if (workspace's client's phase = 8) or (view's active = false):
        dismiss UI source tools tools
        set tools's edited to false
        set tools's composed to false
        return false
    set editor to workspace's editors
    loop while editor != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source editor):
        if editor's node = view's text focus:
            if ((UI source element (editor's node) is active within (view's instance's description) in (view's instance)) and (editor's document's available)) and (the UI element (editor's node) is enabled in (view's instance)):
                set layout to the UI layout for element (editor's node) in (view's layout)
                require condition (layout != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout)) reporting "A source editor is missing its view layout"
                if view's selection's caret source = (the address of (layout's text source)):
                    set value to the UI value for (editor's node) in (view's instance)
                    if editor's document's writable:
                        edit UI source document (editor's document) to (value's text) at (view's seconds) seconds
                    remember the UI source location of editor in view
                    if (tools's node != editor's node) or (tools's document != editor's document):
                        dismiss UI source tools tools
                        set tools's edited to false
                        set tools's composed to false
                    else if tools's source != value's text:
                        if value's undo = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit):
                            set tools's edited to false
                        else if value's undo's after != value's text:
                            set tools's edited to false
                    set tools's node to editor's node
                    set tools's document to editor's document
                    set tools's source to value's text
                    return true
        set editor to editor's next
    dismiss UI source tools tools
    set tools's node to @intrinsic("construct", UI reference)
    set tools's document to @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source document)
    set tools's source to ""
    set tools's edited to false
    set tools's composed to false
    return false

